 through intricate strategy screens. Swiftly adapt to ever-changing weather, unexpected crashes, and the emergence of safety cars.\n\nUNLEASH VARIETY ON THE TRACK\nEmbark on thrilling GT and Endurance racing adventures across six distinct championships. Immerse yourself in the iconic beauty of Monaco's settings, rendered in breathtaking artistry.\n\nDRIVERS TAKE CENTER STAGE\nStep into the shoes of promising new drivers, delve into their statistics, and cultivate pivotal relationships. Navigate the revamped HQ, seize upgrade opportunities, and master the new part development system for an immersive journey.\n\nYOUR JOURNEY, YOUR CHALLENGE\nEmbark on a motorsport odyssey where every choice shapes your destiny. Witness dynamic AI team movements and adjust the difficulty level as the game evolves with you.\n\nSEIZE CONTROL, MAKE HISTORY\nIt's your opportunity to rewrite the annals of racing lore and etch your name into the history of motorsport. Motorsport Manager 4 empowers you like never before.", "minimumOsVersion": "13.0", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN", "FR", "DE", "IT", "PT", "ES"], "fileSizeBytes": "510243840", "formattedPrice": "￦7,700", "trackContentRating": "12+", "averageUserRating": 4.56667, "bundleId": "com.playsportgames.mmm2023", "trackCensoredName": "Motorsport Manager 4", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/motorsport-manager-4/id6449251957?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "12+", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 30, "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 4.56667, "userRatingCount": 30}]}